#. command help: didact inv add
#: didact/commands/inventory.py
msgid ""
"A name that matches a compendium item, or an `item:` record, brings its details:\n"
"size, damage, armor, uses. The options apply to every item named. Going past the\n"
"slots is refused (strict), warned about (lenient) or allowed with --force; filling\n"
"them fires the sheet's `when_full` hook (HP dropping to 0, say)."
msgstr ""
"Nama yang sepadan dengan barang dalam kompendium, atau rekod `item:`, membawa\n"
"butirannya: saiz, kerosakan, perisai, penggunaan. Pilihan terpakai kepada setiap barang\n"
"yang dinamakan. Melebihi slot ditolak (strict), diberi amaran (lenient) atau dibenarkan\n"
"dengan --force; slot yang penuh mencetuskan hook `when_full` helaian watak (contohnya HP\n"
"jatuh ke 0)."

