#. command help: didact about
#: didact/commands/knowledge.py
msgid ""
"Details are short named notes for whoever runs the game; keep them current and the\n"
"game stays consistent. Suggested names depend on the record (looks, personality,\n"
"wants, fears, attitude, doing, plan, where, history, powers, state, secret,\n"
"thoughts); any one-word name works. `thoughts` is for your own ideas about what you\n"
"made. Players see only `looks`; `reveal <record> <name>` shows them another.\n"
"Without values: the details, the suggestions still open, the record's chronicle\n"
"(journal beats `--about` it), what it holds and where it is. This view is for the GM."
msgstr ""
"Butiran ialah nota pendek bernama untuk sesiapa yang mengendalikan permainan; pastikan\n"
"ia terkini dan permainan kekal konsisten. Nama yang dicadangkan bergantung pada rekod\n"
"(looks, personality, wants, fears, attitude, doing, plan, where, history, powers, state,\n"
"secret, thoughts); sebarang nama satu perkataan boleh digunakan. `thoughts` adalah untuk\n"
"idea anda sendiri tentang apa yang anda cipta. Pemain hanya melihat `looks`;\n"
"`reveal <record> <name>` menunjukkan butiran lain kepada mereka. Tanpa nilai:\n"
"butirannya, cadangan yang masih terbuka, kronikel rekod (peristiwa jurnal yang `--about`\n"
"rekod itu), apa yang dipegangnya dan di mana ia berada. Paparan ini untuk GM."

