#. command help: didact reset
#: didact/commands/care.py
msgid "Empty the library, as if Didact were newly installed (shown first; backed up first)"
msgstr "Kosongkan pustaka, seolah-olah Didact baru dipasang (ditunjukkan dahulu; disandarkan dahulu)"

#: didact/web/pages/library.py
msgid ""
"Empty the library, as if Didact were newly installed: every world, campaign and change goes, and "
"numbering starts again at #e1. A backup is made first, and backups stay."
msgstr ""
"Kosongkan pustaka, seolah-olah Didact baru dipasang: setiap dunia, kempen dan perubahan hilang, "
"dan penomboran bermula semula dari #e1. Sandaran dibuat dahulu, dan sandaran kekal."

#: didact/web/pages/library.py
msgid "Enable"
msgstr "Dayakan"

#: didact/web/pages/library.py
msgid ""
"Enabling a pack adds it to the open campaign. The core pack is always on, and one game system is "
"in use at a time: the open world's, which it keeps for good."
msgstr ""
"Mendayakan pek menambahkannya pada kempen yang terbuka. Pek core sentiasa aktif, dan hanya satu "
"sistem permainan digunakan pada satu masa: sistem dunia yang terbuka, yang dikekalkannya buat "
"selama-lamanya."

#: didact/web/pages/overview.py
msgid "End session"
msgstr "Tamatkan sesi"

#. command help: didact scene end
#: didact/commands/play.py
msgid "End the current scene (optionally with its summary)"
msgstr "Tamatkan adegan semasa (secara pilihan dengan ringkasannya)"

#. command help: didact combat end
#: didact/commands/combat.py
msgid "End the fight"
msgstr "Tamatkan pertarungan"

#. command help: didact session end
#: didact/commands/play.py
msgid "End the session (give its summary now, or later with `summary write session`)"
msgstr "Tamatkan sesi (berikan ringkasannya sekarang, atau kemudian dengan `summary write session`)"

#: didact/web/pages/library.py
msgid ""
"Every change, newest first. Undo takes the last one back, or pick one; jump back to a change to "
"take back everything after it."
msgstr ""
"Setiap perubahan, yang terbaharu dahulu. Buat asal membatalkan yang terakhir, atau pilih satu; "
"lompat balik ke sesuatu perubahan untuk menarik balik semua yang berlaku selepasnya."

#. command help: didact faction turn
#: didact/commands/tracking.py
msgid ""
"Every faction that isn't gone takes a turn: the system's `settings.factions.turn`\n"
"rule, or a roll (d6; 4+ ticks each of its clocks: `track new … --for faction:x`).\n"
"Narrate the moves from their agendas. Secret factions act too; `--gm` shows them."
msgstr ""
"Setiap puak yang belum lenyap mengambil giliran: peraturan `settings.factions.turn`\n"
"sistem, atau balingan (d6; 4+ memajukan setiap jamnya: `track new … --for faction:x`).\n"
"Naratifkan gerakan mereka berdasarkan agenda masing-masing. Puak rahsia turut bertindak;\n"
"`--gm` menunjukkannya."

#: didact/web/pages/settings.py
msgid "Every module's documentation, from its docstrings and types."
msgstr "Dokumentasi setiap modul, daripada docstring dan jenisnya."

#. command help: didact gen run
#: didact/commands/drafts.py
msgid ""
"Every roll is logged. `--prefill` gives decisions in advance (a choice takes the\n"
"option it names; a list gives one value per occurrence); `--auto` lets the dice make\n"
"the choices the procedure would otherwise ask about. Then `gen show`, `gen edit`,\n"
"`gen commit`."
msgstr ""
"Setiap balingan dilog. `--prefill` memberikan keputusan lebih awal (bagi sesuatu pilihan,\n"
"yang dinamakan itulah yang diambil; senarai memberikan satu nilai bagi setiap kemunculan);\n"
"`--auto` membiarkan dadu membuat pilihan yang sebaliknya akan ditanya oleh prosedur.\n"
"Kemudian `gen show`, `gen edit`, `gen commit`."

#: didact/web/pages/graph.py
msgid "Every type is switched off: turn one on above."
msgstr "Semua jenis dimatikan: hidupkan satu di atas."

#. command help: didact reset
#: didact/commands/care.py
msgid ""
"Every world, campaign and record goes, with the history, drafts, save points and the\n"
"search index, and numbering starts again: the next change is #e1, the next roll #r1.\n"
"The backups stay, and so do installed packs unless --packs. The library as it is is\n"
"backed up first (snapshot-<time>-before-reset.zip): undo can't take a reset back, but\n"
"restoring that backup can. Without --yes it only shows what would go."
msgstr ""
"Setiap dunia, kempen dan rekod dipadam, bersama sejarah, draf, titik simpan dan indeks\n"
"carian, dan penomboran bermula semula: perubahan seterusnya #e1, balingan seterusnya\n"
"#r1. Sandaran kekal, begitu juga pek yang dipasang melainkan dengan --packs. Pustaka\n"
"disandarkan dahulu seadanya (snapshot-<time>-before-reset.zip): buat asal tidak boleh\n"
"membatalkan tetapan semula, tetapi memulihkan sandaran itu boleh. Tanpa --yes ia hanya\n"
"menunjukkan apa yang akan dipadam."

#: didact/web/pages/library.py
msgid ""
"Everything after it is taken back, newest first: each change is undone, and each roll is marked "
"undone. Nothing is deleted: Redo, or jumping back to a later change, brings it back."
msgstr ""
"Semua yang berlaku selepasnya ditarik balik, bermula daripada yang terbaharu: setiap perubahan "
"dibuat asal, dan setiap balingan ditanda sebagai dibuat asal. Tiada apa-apa yang dipadam: Buat "
"semula, atau lompat balik ke perubahan yang lebih kemudian, mengembalikannya."

#: didact/web/pages/library.py
msgid "Everything but the newest ones you keep goes for good: this can't be undone."
msgstr ""
"Semua kecuali yang terbaharu yang anda simpan akan hilang selama-lamanya: tindakan ini tidak "
"boleh dibuat asal."

#: didact/web/pages/library.py
msgid ""
"Everything in the library but its backups is replaced by the backup's. The library as it is now "
"is backed up first: undo can't take a restore back, but restoring that backup can."
msgstr ""
"Semua kandungan pustaka kecuali sandarannya diganti dengan kandungan sandaran. Pustaka semasa "
"disandarkan dahulu: buat asal tidak dapat membatalkan pemulihan, tetapi memulihkan sandaran itu "
"boleh."

#. command help: didact world delete
#: didact/commands/library.py
msgid ""
"Everything in the world goes: its records, maps, lore and every campaign in it\n"
"(sessions, journals, transcripts, oracle state). Without --yes it shows what would\n"
"go and stages the change for `didact apply <id>`. `didact undo` brings it all back,\n"
"byte for byte. The event log keeps its history either way."
msgstr ""
"Segala-galanya dalam dunia dipadam: rekod, peta, lore dan setiap kempen di dalamnya\n"
"(sesi, jurnal, transkrip, keadaan peramal). Tanpa --yes ia menunjukkan apa yang akan\n"
"dipadam dan menyediakan perubahan untuk `didact apply <id>`. `didact undo` mengembalikan\n"
"semuanya, bait demi bait. Log peristiwa tetap menyimpan sejarahnya dalam kedua-dua\n"
"keadaan."

