msgid ""
"Follows the inventories: a sword in a chest in a house shows as `in Chest › at My\n"
"House`. Put things somewhere with `didact inv move <who> <item> <record>`: a place\n"
"or a container record holds items like a character does. The player view leaves out\n"
"secret holders; --gm also shows a record's own `where` detail."
msgstr ""
"Mengikuti inventori: pedang dalam peti dalam rumah dipaparkan sebagai\n"
"`in Chest › at My House`. Letakkan barang di suatu tempat dengan\n"
"`didact inv move <who> <item> <record>`: rekod tempat atau bekas memegang barang seperti\n"
"watak. Paparan pemain meninggalkan pemegang yang rahsia; --gm juga menunjukkan butiran\n"
"`where` rekod itu sendiri."

