#. command help: didact pack enable
#: didact/commands/packs.py
msgid ""
"One game system is in use at a time: the open world's. A world keeps the system it\n"
"was made with, so enabling a system only gives one to a world that has none yet;\n"
"another system plays in a world of its own (`didact world new <id> --system <pack>`).\n"
"A pack that needs another system (a setting written for it) can't be added either."
msgstr ""
"Hanya satu sistem permainan digunakan pada satu masa: sistem dunia yang terbuka. Dunia\n"
"mengekalkan sistem yang digunakan semasa ia dicipta, jadi mendayakan sistem hanya\n"
"memberikan sistem kepada dunia yang belum mempunyainya; sistem lain dimainkan dalam\n"
"dunianya sendiri (`didact world new <id> --system <pack>`). Pek yang memerlukan sistem\n"
"lain (latar yang ditulis untuknya) juga tidak boleh ditambah."

#. command help: didact search
#: didact/commands/reference.py
msgid ""
"One ranked list across every source (every word must appear; titles count most).\n"
"Each hit ends with the command that shows it. Records follow player-safe rules\n"
"unless you pass --gm. Sources: rules, terms, mechanics, tables, compendium, records,\n"
"transcript, docs."
msgstr ""
"Satu senarai berperingkat merentas setiap sumber (setiap perkataan mesti muncul; tajuk\n"
"paling diambil kira). Setiap padanan berakhir dengan arahan yang memaparkannya. Rekod\n"
"mengikut peraturan selamat untuk pemain melainkan anda memberikan --gm. Sumber: rules,\n"
"terms, mechanics, tables, compendium, records, transcript, docs."

