#. command help: didact lore import
#: didact/commands/lore.py
msgid ""
"Reads SillyTavern World Info (KoboldAI writes the same), the lorebook inside a\n"
"character card (`character_book`), and NovelAI's .lorebook. Each enabled entry becomes\n"
"a lore entry: its keys, secondary keys and logic, constant, order (priority),\n"
"probability, group, sticky, cooldown, delay and recursion carry over. Placement and\n"
"scan settings don't: Didact decides those. Entries go to the campaign unless --scope\n"
"says otherwise; a name already taken gets a number. Undoable like any change."
msgstr ""
"Membaca World Info SillyTavern (KoboldAI menulis format yang sama), lorebook di dalam\n"
"kad watak (`character_book`), dan .lorebook NovelAI. Setiap entri yang didayakan menjadi\n"
"entri lore: kunci, kunci sekunder dan logiknya, constant, order (keutamaan),\n"
"kebarangkalian, kumpulan, sticky, cooldown, delay dan rekursi dibawa bersama. Penempatan dan\n"
"tetapan imbasan tidak: Didact yang menentukannya. Entri masuk ke kempen melainkan --scope\n"
"menyatakan sebaliknya; nama yang sudah diambil diberi nombor. Boleh dibuat asal seperti sebarang "
"perubahan."

