#. command help: didact gen run
#: didact/commands/drafts.py
msgid "Run a generator into a draft (#g7): nothing is written until `gen commit`"
msgstr "Jalankan penjana ke dalam draf (#g7): tiada apa-apa ditulis sehingga `gen commit`"

#. command help: didact pack test
#: didact/commands/packs.py
msgid "Run a pack's tests: table rolls, expressions, odds and smoke-play scripts"
msgstr "Jalankan ujian pek: balingan jadual, ungkapan, peluang dan skrip main percubaan"

#. command help: didact do
#: didact/commands/rules.py
msgid ""
"Run a rule from the enabled packs with name=value parameters (a flag can stand alone:\n"
"`protect` is `protect=true`). Dice are rolled and logged, changes are applied as one\n"
"undoable change, and prompts tell you what to\n"
"narrate or decide. A roll that allows push/burn/reroll comes back pending: finish it\n"
"with `didact resolve <roll> <option>`."
msgstr ""
"Jalankan peraturan daripada pek yang didayakan dengan parameter name=value (bendera\n"
"boleh berdiri sendiri: `protect` ialah `protect=true`). Dadu dibaling dan dilog,\n"
"perubahan diterapkan sebagai satu perubahan yang boleh dibuat asal, dan soalan panduan\n"
"memberitahu anda apa yang perlu dinaratifkan atau diputuskan. Balingan yang membenarkan\n"
"push/burn/reroll kembali dalam keadaan tertangguh: selesaikannya dengan\n"
"`didact resolve <roll> <option>`."

#. command help: didact do
#: didact/commands/rules.py
msgid "Run a rule: a check, action, procedure or trigger (rules as function calls)"
msgstr "Jalankan peraturan: semakan, tindakan, prosedur atau pencetus (peraturan sebagai panggilan fungsi)"

#: didact/web/pages/commands.py didact/web/pages/reference.py
msgid "Run it"
msgstr "Jalankan"

#. command help: didact batch
#: didact/commands/meta.py
msgid "Run several commands in one call: one per line, from stdin or a file"
msgstr "Jalankan beberapa arahan dalam satu panggilan: satu setiap baris, daripada stdin atau fail"

#. command help: didact serve
#: didact/commands/web.py
msgid ""
"Runs a small web app on this machine until Ctrl-C: records, a graph of their links,\n"
"the journal, rules and tables, the library, and every command as a form. Changes run\n"
"the same commands as the command line, so they are checked, logged and undoable, and\n"
"each one shows its command line. Secrets stay hidden unless the GM view is on (--gm\n"
"starts with it on). It listens on 127.0.0.1 only unless --host says otherwise.\n"
"\n"
"--demo serves the sample campaign (`didact sample`) from a library of its own, with\n"
"every pack that ships with Didact installed, built afresh each time it starts: a place\n"
"to try things without touching your own.\n"
"More: `didact guide web`."
msgstr ""
"Menjalankan aplikasi web kecil pada mesin ini sehingga Ctrl-C: rekod, graf pautannya,\n"
"jurnal, peraturan dan jadual, pustaka, dan setiap arahan sebagai borang. Perubahan\n"
"menjalankan arahan yang sama seperti baris arahan, jadi ia disemak, dilog dan boleh\n"
"dibuat asal, dan setiap satu menunjukkan baris arahannya. Rahsia kekal tersembunyi\n"
"melainkan paparan GM dihidupkan (--gm memulakannya dalam keadaan hidup). Ia hanya\n"
"mendengar pada 127.0.0.1 melainkan --host menyatakan sebaliknya.\n"
"\n"
"--demo menyajikan kempen contoh (`didact sample`) daripada pustakanya sendiri, dengan\n"
"setiap pek yang disertakan bersama Didact sudah dipasang. Pustaka itu dibina baharu setiap\n"
"kali ia bermula: tempat untuk mencuba tanpa menyentuh pustaka anda sendiri.\n"
"Lagi: `didact guide web`."

#. command help: didact cache clear
#: didact/commands/library.py
msgid ""
"Safe any time: your library's files are the truth. The next command rebuilds the\n"
"search index of the library it opens, and packs recompile as they load. It touches\n"
"nothing else: not the library, not other files in the cache folder, and not what\n"
"`pack build` wrote into a pack's `.build/` folder. For the developer caches in a\n"
"checkout of Didact (mypy, ruff, pytest, pack builds), use `make clean`."
msgstr ""
"Selamat pada bila-bila masa: fail pustaka anda ialah sumber kebenaran. Arahan seterusnya\n"
"membina semula indeks carian pustaka yang dibukanya, dan pek dikompil semula semasa\n"
"dimuatkan. Ia tidak menyentuh apa-apa yang lain: bukan pustaka, bukan fail lain dalam\n"
"folder cache, dan bukan apa yang ditulis oleh `pack build` ke dalam folder `.build/`\n"
"sesebuah pek. Untuk cache pembangun dalam salinan kerja Didact (mypy, ruff, pytest,\n"
"binaan pek), gunakan `make clean`."

