msgid ""
"The variant and optional rules this campaign plays with, as its system describes them: its rules,"
" character creation and generators follow them, and the brief tells the GM what they can't "
"enforce. Each says what it does; leave one at its default to follow the system, or what another "
"option implies."
msgstr ""
"Varian dan peraturan pilihan yang dimainkan kempen ini, seperti yang diterangkan sistemnya: "
"peraturan, penciptaan watak dan penjana mengikutinya, dan ringkasan memberitahu GM apa yang tidak"
" dapat dikuatkuasakan. Setiap satu menyatakan fungsinya; biarkan satu pilihan pada nilai lalainya"
" untuk mengikut sistem, atau apa yang disiratkan oleh pilihan lain."

#. command help: didact campaign delete
#: didact/commands/library.py
msgid ""
"The world and its records stay; the campaign's own records, sessions, journal,\n"
"transcripts, oracle state and save points go. Without --yes it shows what would go\n"
"and stages the change for `didact apply <id>`. `didact undo` brings it all back."
msgstr ""
"Dunia dan rekodnya kekal; rekod kempen itu sendiri, sesi, jurnal, transkrip, keadaan\n"
"peramal dan titik simpannya dipadam. Tanpa --yes ia menunjukkan apa yang akan dipadam\n"
"dan menyediakan perubahan untuk `didact apply <id>`. `didact undo` mengembalikan\n"
"semuanya."

