" disimpan."

#. command help: didact snapshot
#: didact/commands/care.py
msgid ""
"Zips the whole data home (all but its backups) into backups/. Ending a session\n"
"makes one too (snapshot-<time>-auto.zip), and only the newest five of those stay.\n"
"\n"
"--restore shows what a backup holds next to the library now. With --yes it backs\n"
"the library up as it is (snapshot-<time>-before-restore.zip), then puts the\n"
"backup's files in place of everything but the backups. Undo can't take a restore\n"
"back: restoring that backup can. Event and roll numbers carry on.\n"
"\n"
"--remove and --keep delete backups for good: they aren't part of the library's\n"
"history, so undo can't bring them back."
msgstr ""
"Mengezip seluruh direktori data (kecuali sandarannya) ke dalam backups/. Menamatkan sesi\n"
"juga membuat satu (snapshot-<time>-auto.zip), dan hanya lima yang terbaharu disimpan.\n"
"\n"
"--restore menunjukkan isi sandaran bersebelahan dengan pustaka sekarang. Dengan --yes ia\n"
"menyandarkan pustaka seadanya (snapshot-<time>-before-restore.zip), kemudian meletakkan\n"
"fail sandaran menggantikan segala-galanya kecuali sandaran. Buat asal tidak boleh\n"
"membatalkan pemulihan: memulihkan sandaran itu boleh. Nombor peristiwa dan balingan\n"
"terus bersambung.\n"
"\n"
"--remove dan --keep memadam sandaran buat selama-lamanya: sandaran bukan sebahagian\n"
"daripada sejarah pustaka, jadi buat asal tidak dapat mengembalikannya."

